                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• Add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of models in this unit.
• This model has the following ability:
&apos;Light of the Emperor&apos;s Grace [Aura]: While an enemy psyker unit is within 12&quot; of this model, subtract 1 from Psychic tests taken for that unit.&apos;</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
