              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit that is on the battlefield. Until the end of the battle, each time a melee attack is made by this model&apos;s unit against that enemy unit, you can re-roll the hit roll and you can re-roll the wound roll.</characteristic>
